### 1. Inicializar Protocolo MCP
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 1,
  "method": "initialize",
  "params": {
    "protocolVersion": "2024-11-05",
    "capabilities": {},
    "clientInfo": {
      "name": "AntigravityTestClient",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  }
}

### 2. Listar Ferramentas Disponíveis (tools/list)
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 2,
  "method": "tools/list"
}

### 3. Invocação da Ferramenta get-server-status (tools/call)
POST http://localhost:8080/mcp
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jsonrpc": "2.0",
  "id": 3,
  "method": "tools/call",
  "params": {
    "name": "get-server-status",
    "arguments": {}
  }
}
